# --- Spotify "now playing" box ---
# 1. Create an app at https://developer.spotify.com/dashboard and copy its
#    Client ID and Client Secret.
# 2. In the app's Settings, add a Redirect URI:
#      http://localhost:3000/api/spotify/callback   (and your production URL)
# 3. Set SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID and SPOTIFY_CLIENT_SECRET below.
# 4. Start the dev server, visit /api/spotify/auth while logged into Spotify,
#    then copy the refresh token shown at /api/spotify/callback
#    into SPOTIFY_REFRESH_TOKEN below.
# 5. Restart `npm run dev`.
SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID=
SPOTIFY_CLIENT_SECRET=
SPOTIFY_REFRESH_TOKEN=